### Health
GET http://localhost:8787/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### Profile
GET http://localhost:8787/api/v1/profile
Accept: application/json

### Posts
GET http://localhost:8787/api/v1/posts/example-post
Accept: application/json

### Albums
GET http://localhost:8787/api/v1/albums?page=1&size=20
Accept: application/json

### Album photos
GET http://localhost:8787/api/v1/albums/album_1/photos?page=1&size=50
Accept: application/json

### Comments
GET http://localhost:8787/api/v1/comments?target_type=post&target_id=post_1&page=1&size=20
Accept: application/json

### Create comment
POST http://localhost:8787/api/v1/comments
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_TOKEN
Idempotency-Key: REPLACE_WITH_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{"target_type":"post","target_id":"post_1","body":"内容"}

### Toggle like
POST http://localhost:8787/api/v1/likes/toggle
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_TOKEN
Idempotency-Key: REPLACE_WITH_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{"target_type":"post","target_id":"post_1"}

### Reading progress
GET http://localhost:8787/api/v1/reading-progress/book_1
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

### Save reading progress
PUT http://localhost:8787/api/v1/reading-progress/book_1
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_TOKEN
Idempotency-Key: REPLACE_WITH_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{"locator":"epubcfi(/6/4[chapter01]!/4/2)","progress":0.42}
